---
title: "GI Data in Hong Kong"
description: "Example of a Speckle and ArcGIS online viewer of 3D GI data."
---

## CesiumJS

Geotechnical investigation data from Kai Tak, Hong Kong visualized in 3D. The map shows borehole locations, SPT results, and weathering grades.

The [source data](/hk_kai_tak_ags_files.zip) was transformed from the AGS3 format using `bedrock-ge` and exported as GeoJSON for web visualization.
Toggle different data layers and adjust ground transparency to explore the subsurface conditions.

